# Paths scripts/publish_public.sh removes from the public mirror, from every commit.
# One per line, git filter-repo --paths syntax: a plain path matches that file or directory prefix
# (end directories with /), "glob:" and "regex:" prefixes are allowed. Blank lines and # comments skipped.
# Always removed as well, without being listed: private-packs/, packs/fitness/, packs/nutrition/, packs/study/.

# Agent work log and to-do notes for the owner (machine state, local setup, personal action items).
QUESTIONS.md
PROGRESS.md
